# Landing capture scratch and regenerable raw assets.
#
# The webp/mp4 in landing/public/media/ ARE tracked: they are what ships. The
# PNG/WebM masters in landing/assets-src/ are ~7 MB of source material that is
# fully reproducible from the app build:
#
#   cd landing
#   pnpm assets:capture && pnpm assets:overlays   # screens + overlays
#   node scripts/capture-video.mjs               # hero loop
#   pnpm assets:process                          # -> public/media
#
# They stay on disk so `pnpm assets:process` can re-encode without a recapture.
landing/assets-src/
landing/test-results/
landing/playwright-report/
node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
coverage
*.local
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

